{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123715","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123715/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123715/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123715/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123715","id":5542047419,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEm4qbw","number":123715,"title":"LightmapGI: Keep valid texels unchanged when dilating the lightmap","user":{"login":"samjanny","id":3447762,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDc3NjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3447762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny","html_url":"https://github.com/samjanny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-09-22T16:00:51Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T16:09:34Z","closed_at":"2026-09-23T16:09:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123715","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123715","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123715.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123715.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Description\n\nSince 054340bb6, the LightmapGI dilation pass searches the neighborhood\nof every texel, whether it already contains valid lighting data or not.\n\nAs a result, a valid texel can be replaced by the first valid neighbor\nfound by the dilation search. This propagates neighboring lighting data\ninto texels that were already valid instead of only filling empty\ntexels.\n\nThis change only performs the neighbor search while the current texel\nis empty.\n\nValid texels therefore keep their original value, while empty texels\nare still filled from neighboring valid texels, matching the behavior\nbefore 4.4.\n\n## Testing\n\nThe regression was tested with a deterministic LightmapGI bake and\ninstrumentation around the dilation pass.\n\nFor 59 instrumented texels:\n\n- Before the fix, 57 / 57 valid texels were replaced during dilation.\n- After the fix, 57 / 57 valid texels keep exactly the same RGBA value.\n- The 2 / 2 empty texels are still filled correctly.\n- The filled values for those empty texels are unchanged from master.\n\nThe complete baked EXR output matches the previously tested diagnostic\nfix exactly for both regression scenes.\n\nInstrumentation also confirmed that raster position, normals,\nunocclude results, direct lighting, indirect lighting, and ray hits\nbefore the dilation pass are unchanged.\n\nThe change therefore only affects whether already-valid texels are\noverwritten by dilation.\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123715/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123715/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}